# nauvis.surface: the surface of this run. Where the plots go is the world design, nauvis.fk; this
# file holds what is true of the world itself: the ground and how the game watches what is built.
# The base is one plot, and the kit is part of its design (world.fk, kit.fk), so there is no claim
# to keep out of it: every tile inside the plot is yours.
surface  nauvis
mode     play                                   # you see where you look; alerts come to you
terrain  map                                    # map.terrain.json: the bare ground, read at the start
catalog  base
design   nauvis.fk                              # the plot: your world

watch plots:      keep
watch sanctioned: mark 2h
notify            nearby
